x700 text "fn sqstep u32 u32 -> u32\ns mul p1 p1\nr add p0 s\nret r\nend\nfn sumsq -> u32\nr fold sqstep 10 0\nret r\nend"
x701 puts x699 x700
x702 call close x701 
x703 call close x702 
x704 call close x703 
