x761 call close x760 
x762 write x761 2
x763 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x764 puts x762 x763
x765 call open x764 6
x766 write x765 4
x767 write x766 2
