x774 write x773 2
x775 text "e0\nhi lt p2 a\nr select hi p2 a"
x776 puts x774 x775
x777 call close x776 
x778 call close x777 
x779 call close x778 
x780 call open x779 13
x781 write x780 4
x782 write x781 1
x783 text "diagnostics"
x784 puts x782 x783
x785 call open x784 11
x786 write x785 2
x787 text "Diagnostics"
x788 puts x786 x787
x789 call close x788 
x790 call open x789 2
x791 write x790 2
x792 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x793 puts x791 x792
x794 call close x793 
x795 call close x794 
ret x795
end

